# Lines of the engine with the plans INSIGHT.smart must draw for them, the
# arrows of the Engine panel's eye: every client replays them. Recorded with
# pragma-explain --insight --record smart/tests/plans.insight "<moves>".
insight a knight's route in the Spanish: Nb1-d2-f1-g3
fen r1b2rk1/2q1bppp/p2p1n2/npp1p3/3PP3/2P2N1P/PPB2PP1/RNBQR1K1 w - - 1 12
line b1d2 c5d4 c3d4 c8d7 d2f1 a8c8 f1g3 a5c6 c1e3
expect b1g3 via d2 f1
end
insight both kings march in a pawn endgame
fen 8/5k2/8/3p4/3P4/8/5K2/8 w - - 0 1
line f2e3 f7e6 e3f4 e6d6 f4f5 d6c6 f5e5
expect f2e5 via e3 f4 f5
expect f7c6 via e6
end
insight a rook lift: Ra1-a3-h3
fen 6k1/5ppp/8/8/8/8/5PPP/R5K1 w - - 0 1
line a1a3 h7h6 a3h3
expect a1h3 via a3
end
insight a pawn storm on one wing is one plan: the g-pawn, not the h-pawn too
fen r1bq1rk1/pp2ppbp/2np1np1/8/3NP3/2N1BP2/PPPQ2PP/2KR1B1R w - - 0 10
line g2g4 a8b8 h2h4 a7a6 h4h5 b7b5 g4g5
expect g2g5
end
insight exchanges and a queen out early are no plan
line e2e4 d7d5 e4d5 d8d5 b1c3 d5a5
expect -
end
insight pieces that go and come back are no plan
line g1f3 g8f6 f3g1 f6g8 b1c3 b8c6 c3b1 c6b8
expect -
end
insight the bishop retreats to a7 in the Italian
fen r1bqkb1r/pppp1ppp/2n2n2/4p3/2B1P3/5N2/PPPP1PPP/RNBQK2R w KQkq - 4 4
line d2d3 f8c5 c2c3 a7a6 e1g1 d7d6 f1e1 c5a7 b2b4 e8g8 h2h3 c8e6 b1d2 h7h6 c4b3 f6h5
expect f8a7 via c5
end
insight a pawn runs and promotes
fen 8/8/1k6/8/P7/8/6K1/8 w - - 0 1
line a4a5 b6c6 a5a6 c6c7 a6a7 c7b7 a7a8q b7c7
expect a4a8
end
insight a knight that goes back and forth: its route without the loop, Nb1-a3-b5
fen r1b2rk1/2q1bppp/p2p1n2/npp1p3/3PP3/2P2N1P/PPB2PP1/RNBQR1K1 w - - 1 12
line d4d5 a5c4 b2b3 c4b6 c1e3 c5c4 b1a3 c8d7 f3d2 c4b3 a2b3 f8b8 a3b1 a6a5 b1a3 b5b4 a3b5
expect b1b5 via a3
expect b5b4
end
insight a rook that goes and comes back part of the way along one line: one leg, Rf1-c1-c7
fen 6k1/5ppp/8/8/8/8/5PPP/5RK1 w - - 0 1
line f1b1 h7h6 b1c1 h6h5 c1c7
expect f1c7 via c1
end
